            "value" : "Arbeit pro km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "x-axis: distance in km. Each ride has its own colour, dash and shape; shorter rides end earlier." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "x-Achse: Strecke in km. Jede Fahrt hat eigene Farbe, Strichart und Form; kürzere Fahrten enden früher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jahr"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday, %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gestern, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this any time in Settings › Import." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lässt sich jederzeit in den Einstellungen unter Import ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can compare 2 to 4 rides. Deselect some rides first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vergleichen geht mit 2 bis 4 Fahrten. Hebe die Markierung einzelner Fahrten auf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can restore them from the trash for 30 days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst sie 30 Tage lang aus dem Papierkorb wiederherstellen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You confirm the place once; Wattspur creates the folder if it is missing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bestätigst den Ort einmal; Wattspur legt den Ordner an, falls er fehlt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have the newest version, %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast die neueste Version, %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have version %@. Download the new one from GitHub and replace the app in Applications; your rides stay as they are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast Version %@. Lade die neue von GitHub und ersetze die App im Ordner „Programme“; deine Fahrten bleiben unverändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have version %@. The new version is on GitHub; replace the app in Applications with it. Your rides stay as they are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast Version %@. Die neue Version liegt auf GitHub; ersetze damit die App im Ordner „Programme“. Deine Fahrten bleiben unverändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Jahr %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your average" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ø deiner Fahrten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your best values across all rides · the sample ride does not count" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Bestwerte über alle Fahrten · die Beispielfahrt zählt nicht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your first bike" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein erstes Bike"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rides stay on this Mac. Wattspur sends no data about you or your rides. The map loads map tiles and place information from Apple, and Wattspur asks GitHub once a day whether a new version is out (switch off in Settings)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Fahrten bleiben auf diesem Mac. Wattspur sendet keine Daten über dich oder deine Fahrten. Die Karte lädt Kartenmaterial und Ortsinformationen von Apple, und Wattspur fragt einmal am Tag bei GitHub nach, ob es eine neue Version gibt (in den Einstellungen abschaltbar)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rides of %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fahrten vom %@"
          }
        }
      }
    }
